WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.374 --> 00:00:03.024
Unit fourteen. Safe Food!

2
00:00:04.001 --> 00:00:07.369
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:07.419 --> 00:00:10.819
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:10.869 --> 00:00:14.138
Today we learn about Safe Food. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.292 --> 00:00:18.292
Food. Say it with me. Food!

6
00:00:21.794 --> 00:00:25.194
Cook. Say it with me. Cook!

7
00:00:28.692 --> 00:00:32.109
Fridge. Say it with me. Fridge!

8
00:00:35.618 --> 00:00:39.051
Wash. Say it with me. Wash!

9
00:00:42.541 --> 00:00:45.991
Flies. Say it with me. Flies!

10
00:00:49.474 --> 00:00:52.808
Fresh. Say it with me. Fresh!

11
00:00:56.309 --> 00:00:59.675
Spoiled. Say it with me. Spoiled!

12
00:01:03.184 --> 00:01:06.517
Cover. Say it with me. Cover!

13
00:01:10.029 --> 00:01:19.908
Safe food is fresh, well cooked, and kept covered from flies. We wash fruit and vegetables and keep leftovers in the fridge. Spoiled food can make us sick.

14
00:01:19.958 --> 00:01:21.234
I can do that too!

15
00:01:22.383 --> 00:01:27.740
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:27.790 --> 00:01:28.940
Fridge!

17
00:01:29.808 --> 00:01:34.899
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:34.949 --> 00:01:36.099
Spoiled!

19
00:01:37.056 --> 00:01:42.887
Did you know? Flies can carry germs from rubbish onto food, so covering food matters!

20
00:01:42.937 --> 00:01:45.207
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:46.655 --> 00:01:54.490
Think and answer. How can you tell if food might be spoiled?

22
00:01:54.540 --> 00:01:55.690
Great answer!

23
00:01:56.811 --> 00:02:01.490
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:01.540 --> 00:02:04.026
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

